  "claim": {
    "short": "Full mouse-tissue x human-compartment Spearman matrix on the 11 proteostasis pathways (and the 14 non-proteostasis controls from the same 25-pathway overlap), generalizing PR #9 from the single gastrocnemius anchor to all six mouse tissues. Companion supplementary figure (v8/figures/SupplementaryFigure_Proteostasis_Conservation.{png,pdf}) renders both panels as a heatmap with mission groupings and per-cell Spearman r annotations. Mouse gastrocnemius is the only tissue with broadly positive Spearman r across human compartments on the proteostasis-11 set; mouse skin/eye/liver/kidney are anti-correlated. Within-overlap control on nonproteostasis-14 shows no comparable row-dominant structure.",
    "scope": "exploratory",
    "consumed_by": [
      "v8/bridge/evaluation/proteostasis_matrix.csv",
